---
/**
 * Decision Passage hero motion.
 *
 * Narrative: inputs -> frame -> challenge -> judgement -> resolve.
 * Four neutral routes establish the decision field before the green route enters.
 * The final geometry inherits the approved Through-flow Passage composition and is
 * deliberately recomposed for desktop, tablet and mobile.
 */
